# Paths ripgrep skips on top of .gitignore. Claude Code's Grep tool and VS Code's search
# both honour this file, so a search for a common word returns code rather than data.
# The files stay in git and on disk; open them directly when you need them.

# One-line data files: any match prints megabytes.
src/lib/g2p/data/*.json
src-tauri/resources/*.json

# Citation style XML: matches "title", "date", "author" thousands of times.
src/lib/references/csl-styles/

# Generated from the Rust #[typeshare] types; search the Rust source instead.
src/types/inkblot-core.ts

package-lock.json
src-tauri/Cargo.lock

# Prose fixtures and media.
showcase/fixtures/books/texts.json
public/media/

# Design-review rounds and the audit: options weighed, not current rules (those are in
# docs/DESIGN.md and docs/design-review/decisions.md). The design-review skill still
# writes and links them here.
docs/design-review/rounds/
docs/design-review/audit.md
